      "filename": "Lascar The Forbidden City (4496269343).jpg",
      "title": "File:Lascar The Forbidden City (4496269343).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/07/Lascar_The_Forbidden_City_%284496269343%29.jpg",
